{"id":"f5fe650c2516d625","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-collapsing-traces.md","title":"Collapsing边合并及静态逆函数边界","display":"ex-collapsing-traces — Collapsing边合并及静态逆函数边界","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-collapsing-traces","aliases":["56-ex-collapsing-traces"],"display":"ex-collapsing-traces — Collapsing边合并及静态逆函数边界","depends_on":["[[56-df-proofterm-traces]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§8.6.1 Definition 8.6.7; Example 8.6.10; Proposition 8.6.11","source_printed_pages":"389,391–392","source_djvu_pages":[412,414],"source_statement_status":"definition-and-figure-rendered; inverse-function-counterexample-local","source_proof_status":"complete-relation-enumeration; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-collapsing-traces"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-collapsing-traces</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-collapsing-traces — Collapsing边合并及静态逆函数边界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" href=\"?note=613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-traces\">56-df-proofterm-traces</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.6.1 Definition 8.6.7; Example 8.6.10; Proposition 8.6.11"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"389,391–392"},{"key":"source_djvu_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>412</span><span>414</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"definition-and-figure-rendered; inverse-function-counterexample-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"complete-relation-enumeration; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>签名含一元符号g及常量a，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R=\\{(g(x),x)\\}\">\\(R=\\{(g(x),x)\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" href=\"?note=613e5d5bb6ec9bee\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-traces\">56-df-proofterm-traces</a> 的变量集。证明项与位置trace采用该节点，具体步嵌入采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b=(g(a),(\\epsilon,g(x),x),a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\">\\(b=(g(a),(\\epsilon,g(x),x),a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi=e_R(b)\">\\(\\phi=e_R(b)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota=(1)\\in W\">\\(\\iota=(1)\\in W\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)=\n\\{(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon)),(V(\\iota),V(\\epsilon))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)=\n\\{(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon)),(V(\\iota),V(\\epsilon))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)=\n\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\cup\\{(V(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)=\n\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\cup\\{(V(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E(\\epsilon)\\ne E(\\iota),\\qquad\n(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E(\\epsilon)\\ne E(\\iota),\\qquad\n(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(a)\\;\\forall z,z&#39;\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(g(a))\\;\n(((z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z&#39;,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi))\\Rightarrow z=z&#39;)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(a)\\;\\forall z,z&#39;\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(g(a))\\;\n(((z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z&#39;,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi))\\Rightarrow z=z&#39;)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>将常量a的两点恒等关系代入规则trace公式：根入边保留；变量位置1搬到空位置，连同其根边一起搬运；动态模式另外把g顶点送到目标入边。所列静态3对、动态4对已经穷尽关系。目标顶点a的来源仍唯一，目标根边有两个静态来源及三个动态祖先。</p>\n<p>此例与书中第391页图8.36右图的局部g(a)→a一致，证明8.6.11第二句不能直接用于所有边位置。保留字面trace公式，并在本轮“祖先存在”原子把来源唯一性限制到顶点；没有为使原句成立而偷偷删除变量实例的根边。后续切片、前缀及归约策略证明使用关系逆像，不需要这个失败的全边逆函数性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-proofterm-traces","status":"resolved","id":"613e5d5bb6ec9bee","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-traces]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-traces","status":"resolved","id":"613e5d5bb6ec9bee","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"签名含一元符号g及常量a，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$R=\\{(g(x),x)\\}$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 是 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]] 的变量集。证明项与位置trace采用该节点，具体步嵌入采用 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$b=(g(a),(\\epsilon,g(x),x),a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$\\phi=e_R(b)$；$\\iota=(1)\\in W$。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"签名含一元符号g及常量a，$x\\in\\mathcal V$，$R=\\{(g(x),x)\\}$，其中 $\\mathcal V$ 是 [[56-df-proofterm-traces]] 的变量集。证明项与位置trace采用该节点，具体步嵌入采用 [[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$b=(g(a),(\\epsilon,g(x),x),a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R$，$\\phi=e_R(b)$；$\\iota=(1)\\in W$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"R=\\{(g(x),x)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"b=(g(a),(\\epsilon,g(x),x),a)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi=e_R(b)","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota=(1)\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)=\n\\{(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon)),(V(\\iota),V(\\epsilon))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm d}(\\phi)=\n\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\cup\\{(V(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"E(\\epsilon)\\ne E(\\iota),\\qquad\n(E(\\epsilon),E(\\epsilon)),(E(\\iota),E(\\epsilon))\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\neg\\bigl(\\forall w\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(a)\\;\\forall z,z'\\in\\operatorname{TPos}(g(a))\\;\n(((z,w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi)\\land(z',w)\\in\\operatorname{Tr}_R^{\\mathrm s}(\\phi))\\Rightarrow z=z')\\bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":2385,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-128","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-ex-collapsing-traces.md]]"}],"outgoing":["613e5d5bb6ec9bee","c273fed319bca9e3"]}